&lt;h2&gt;Agents use your saved sign-in and confirm host keys&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agents fill in saved passwords and answers the way the app does, and a changed host key can be confirmed in a dialog without opening the app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Saved sign-in for agents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;With saved authentication allowed, agents use your saved passwords, saved answers, and authentication rules as the app does.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Host key confirmation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;A new or changed host key opens a dialog with the previous and new fingerprints. Agents continue only after you confirm.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stale known_hosts entries&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;An old key in ~/.ssh/known_hosts no longer blocks a server whose current key you trusted in PromeFTP.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps in errors&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Failed agent requests list what to do next, and prompts say why they were not answered automatically.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.8"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
